{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "New Paths", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Gotta Go!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> and the <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> to talk about the future in different ways.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will + infinitive</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">be going to + infinitive</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">intention</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I'll give you a ride to the shop.</span><br><br>(decided at the time of speaking: spontaneous offers, promises, decisions)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I can't help you on Saturday. I'm going to help my girlfriend move into her new apartment  .</span><br><br>(decided before the time of speaking, but not yet fully planned)\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">prediction</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I think you'll find this book very interesting.</span><br><br>(based on personal judgment, opinion or intuition)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My sister is going to have a baby.</span><br><br>(based on present evidence or the predicted event is very near and is sure to happen)\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">arrangement</span> \\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm flying to Paris on the 23rd of this month.</span><br><br>(plans and arragements have been made)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tough nut to crack", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a difficult problem or opponent ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter's dad is a tough nut to crack. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about family.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to memorize", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to learn so you can remember", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Dad expect me to memorize the sports stats every day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to update", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give someone more recent information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Call me and update me on what happened! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to grill", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to question relentlessly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: His father will grill you if you go there for dinner. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "presumptuous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "rude for doing something you have no right to do ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was presumptuous of you to show up uninvited. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "embarrassing ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making you feel uncomfortable or self-conscious ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Forgetting his name was embarrassing. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hold your own", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be able to handle a situation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can hold my own against your father. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud07 ", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "beforehand", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in advance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let me know if you're at the office beforehand, and I'll meet you there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "uncompromising", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fixed; not easily changed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's very uncompromising. His ideas never change. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking on the Phone ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can keep a conversation going in English by talking about different topics. You can ask questions, respond to or comment on what the person you are talking to is telling you.<br /><br /> Example:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">Really? He's a tough nut to crack?</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\">Yeah. He's very uncompromising.</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\">Every morning, he expects me to read the sports stats in the paper, memorize them and then update him over breakfast.</span><br /><br />  When it's time end your conversation, you can say goodbye, or just leave with a comment.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ending a Conversation with Friends\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Bye. Talk to you later!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Gotta go!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Something is coming for you. I feel it. Bye.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Make a list of 10 questions - both comfortable and uncomfortable - that they could ask.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Role-play with a partner. You are at dinner. Have them ask you the questions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Answer politely, but don't get angry or upset.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Trade roles and repeat.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a list of 10 questions to ask someone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I role-play with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen carefully to the questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I answer questions politely.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content