g sometimes.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's ok. I can hold my own. <br>", "time": "25500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know you can, but can I? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll coach you through it beforehand over coffee.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What are you doing today? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh! My yoga class starts in half and hour! I have to go!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ok. We're getting together with V later, remember?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Dinner is at 8. See you then!<br>", "time": "52000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}